1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Scan vial, sterile pod, cap, and audit button.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Visual-servo approach uses learned tactile residual policy.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Five fingers close and tactile contacts stabilize the vial.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:29,000
In-hand cap rotation exceeds 200 degrees without losing the vial.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Slip disturbance is detected and recovered under 1.2 mm.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Vial is delivered to the sterile pod and verified.

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Audit button is pressed after delivery.

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Metrics, stress replay, and policy card are exported.
